1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
And despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Rich or poor, royalty or common,

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
In order to learn the mana method

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
and acquire the power they'll soon need,

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Asta and the others train as hard as they can in the Heart Kingdom.

15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Gotcha this time!

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The power to invalidate magic is second to nothing.

17
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
But you're too narrow-minded to use it to its full potential.

18
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
I'm not done!

19
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Meanwhile, Dami seeks to improve in his own way.

20
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Looks like they're all working hard to push past their limits.

21
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
So I guess I better up my game as well.

22
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
I'll be with you!

23
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
So,何度も 何度も 何度も 目の前の今を超えるさ

