I've been sparring with this guy for days now and I still can't get a single hit in

43
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:27,000
It's fortunate that I opted to hold back you'd be in far worse shape if I hadn't

44
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,000
You've trained to your physical limit

45
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,000
obtain the rare power known as anti-magic

46
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,000
