50
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,000
If you can't find a way to defeat me in one-on-one combat

51
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
You will fall to the Spade Kingdom Devil

52
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,000
You will fall to the Spade Kingdom Devil

