80
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,000
And when I do

81
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
I feel pathetic

82
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Stand up

83
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,000
A lion should never look so pitiful

84
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,000
The stronger I get

85
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
