196
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:11,160
I get it. So if I keep burning through my anti-magic, I'm sure it'll lose.

197
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:21,160
You call that an attack? Come on! This is pathetic!

198
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:31,160
Why wait for the devil to end you? I can do your last rites here and now if you'd like.

199
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:35,160
