203
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:52,160
Come on. You need to come up with an attack that he can't dodge.

204
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:55,160
Something with the range to reach him and the speed to catch him.

205
00:11:56,160 --> 00:12:00,160
I've already seen the powers of the Demon Slayer sword and the Demon Destroyer sword.

206
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:03,160
I assume that this sword is unique as well?

207
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:10,160
Right. The Demon Dweller sword. It probably has powers that I haven't drawn out yet.

208
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:17,160
That reminds me. Right after I found this sword, I channeled Noelle's mana with it.

209
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:22,160
Not sure, but there's a chance I can do the same thing with my own anti-magic.

210
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:26,160
Interesting. I take it you've had an epiphany.

211
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,160
Please let me have another try!

212
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:32,160
If that's what you want, I won't hold back as much this time.

213
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:37,160
If you manage to land a single hit on me, then I'll declare you victorious.

214
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:41,160
To be honest, I wish you'd just go all out!

215
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:47,160
If you won't move, I'll bring the fight to you!

216
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:53,160
You cannot kick the air.

217
00:12:54,160 --> 00:13:02,160
Just as lions toss their young off cliffs to test them, I have absolutely no problem hurling you into the lava!

218
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:05,160
Are you really chasing me right now?

219
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:11,160
Sucks to admit, but Scolion's right. If I let myself lose here...

220
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:16,160
What chance would I have against that devil?

221
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,160
Ah, nice.

222
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:22,160
Looks like I can finally fight you on equal ground.

223
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:25,160
Equal ground? We're floating above lava, fool!

224
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:28,160
You get the point! I'm saying it's an even fight now!

225
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:32,160
Ha! When it comes to mana zone, you're just a baby learning to walk!

226
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:37,160
I need to figure out how to deal with those fists of hers.

227
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:47,160
All right, Asta. It's just like when you borrowed Noelle's mana.

228
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:52,160
I just need to infuse the Demon Dweller's sword with my anti-magic.

229
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:58,160
In accordance with your requests that I stop holding back, I will now show you my true power.

230
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:05,160
I just need to keep increasing my speed with mana zone, and stop her from throwing out any new spells!

231
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:11,160
You're not bad! You've developed a rudimentary grasp of how to use mana zone!

232
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:16,160
