233
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:20,160
Do you seriously think you were holding back before? No way!

234
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:25,160
This gift is to thank you for the good time! Do your best not to let it kill you!

235
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:42,160
Not sure I can stop all that. Then again, I have to!

236
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:50,160
No point in asking if I can! I have to, so I will!

237
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:54,160
Right here, right now! I'll push past my limit!

238
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:58,160
Mana zone, dark magic, black hole!

239
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,160
Okay, now...

240
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:09,160
Is he... nullifying my mana?

241
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:11,160
Dark magic, dark cloak, blightless, slash!

242
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:29,160
Quite impressive...

243
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:29,640
Impressive.

244
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:35,520
Way to go, V! I actually got a hit in!

245
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:39,100
This is getting interesting.

246
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:44,000
Once I've burnt you to cinders, my bath will be that much more enjoyable.

247
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,060
Got the gist of it, so I'm leaving.

248
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,700
Don't be coy, or are you just afraid?

249
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,940
Terrified. I'll catch you later!

250
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,640
Well, that's disappointing.

251
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:06,520
It's time we shared our progress. Please report.

252
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,880
Rill and Charmy are doing great.

253
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:11,640
They both took to the Mono Method faster than expected.

254
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:14,560
They're brilliant, if a little unusual.

255
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,640
The most I can do for them now is prepare their meals

256
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:20,540
and bring out their potential with the occasional word of advice.

257
00:16:21,780 --> 00:16:22,180
Mm-hmm.

258
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:25,340
Charlotte and Mimosa have come a super long way.

259
00:16:25,340 --> 00:16:29,560
They seemed confused at first, but then something went calick in their heads, you know?

260
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:31,200
Our students have grown, too.

261
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:34,180
I suspect they've grown faster than any of yours.

262
00:16:34,660 --> 00:16:38,320
Although, when someone's being instructed by the Queen of the Heart Kingdom

263
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:41,840
and the Great Water Spirit herself, I suppose that's only to be expected.

264
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:44,940
I can tell you're proud of them.

265
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:48,920
Tell me, Smearath, how has Venril been coming along?

266
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:52,740
For the time being, we must let the wind guide us

267
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:55,900
and trust it to nurture the storm that grows within him.

268
00:16:56,420 --> 00:16:59,420
You have an awfully hard time getting to the point, don't you?

269
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:00,880
Did someone say something?

270
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:03,920
I couldn't quite make it out over the whispers of the wind.

271
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:05,320
Don't fight, you two.

272
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:08,120
Floga, how goes it?

273
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:09,100
Not bad.

274
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:12,920
Leo's a talented mage, but he's plagued by self-doubt.

275
00:17:13,820 --> 00:17:17,440
I think you'll get better results if you try to focus on your strengths.

276
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:18,880
My strengths?

277
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:20,340
Like what?

278
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:23,040
You didn't get this far on talent.

279
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:25,280
You did it with patience and determination.

280
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:29,620
Your power grows as your technique improves, with every day of practice.

281
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:33,620
You're the kind of person who has the strength to endure anything.

282
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,640
I mean, you're you, right?

283
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:39,520
The strength to endure anything.

284
00:17:40,380 --> 00:17:43,040
I want to draw out potential he hasn't realized yet.

285
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:44,520
At least that's my idea.

286
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:46,380
We'll see how it goes.

287
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:47,100
Yes.

288
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:49,340
Well, I'm sure you'll get through to him.

289
00:17:49,780 --> 00:17:50,800
And what about Asta?

290
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,740
Asta's anti-magic is uniquely potent.

291
00:17:54,020 --> 00:17:55,480
We'll need it to defeat this devil.

292
00:17:55,480 --> 00:18:00,020
As for Asta's progress, he's becoming stronger in his own way.

293
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:04,520
Unfortunately, time is running short now.

294
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:07,820
Please put everything you have into this training.

295
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:08,820
Yes, ma'am.

296
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:14,360
Let us join together to beat the Spade Kingdom, and the devil lurking within it.

297
00:18:14,360 --> 00:18:28,260
There are so many.

298
00:18:31,620 --> 00:18:34,180
Looks like they're almost ready to start the invasion.

299
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:37,520
If we're going to make our move, we need to be fast.

300
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:38,740
Look there.

301
00:18:38,740 --> 00:18:43,800
How fortunate.

302
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:48,400
Through your labors, you people will get to contribute to the Spade Kingdom's prosperity.

303
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,600
Where are they making us go now?

304
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:51,820
We have to stay quiet.

305
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:54,440
Come on, buddy.

306
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:55,560
You're almost there.

307
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:57,400
Don't, Ralph.

308
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,440
There are too many of them.

309
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,580
I know, but still.

310
00:19:00,580 --> 00:19:05,660
We've reached the strong magic region.

311
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:08,320
It's unlikely that all of us will make it across.

312
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:11,820
But remember, only one of us needs to reach the Clover Kingdom.

313
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:15,120
As long as one of us makes it, there's hope.

314
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,620
Hang on to that hope no matter what happens.

315
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,220
Let's go!

316
00:19:20,220 --> 00:19:26,060
Look at that.

317
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:28,380
We've found ourselves a pack of stray rebels.

318
00:19:29,340 --> 00:19:32,760
Your friend ratted you out, but that isn't too surprising.

319
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:35,620
Not with a beloved child's life on the line.

320
00:19:36,380 --> 00:19:37,060
Run for it!

321
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:45,680
If I bring your heads back to my superior, I'll get a promotion and a raise for sure.

322
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:50,520
Don't turn your back to me!

323
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:53,080
Ralph!

324
00:19:58,420 --> 00:19:59,280
What are you?

325
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:01,420
I'm trusting you with our mana.

326
00:20:01,640 --> 00:20:02,280
Use it well.

327
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:03,940
You're on your own now.

328
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:05,180
You have to pull through.

329
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:05,940
For him!

330
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:07,380
Our hopes go with you.

331
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:09,060
Finish the work your father started.

332
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:13,200
You won't escape us.

333
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,380
Go now!

334
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:24,820
I'll reach the Clover Kingdom, no matter what it takes.

335
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:29,440
Strong magic region is just past this cliff.

336
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,060
Can I really cross it?

337
00:20:32,460 --> 00:20:33,280
Stop that.

338
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:35,640
Don't let their sacrifice go to waste.

339
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:37,860
Follow in your father's footsteps.

340
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:38,820
You can't give up.

341
00:20:40,940 --> 00:20:41,960
There he is!

342
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:42,580
Get him!

343
00:20:42,580 --> 00:20:46,340
I can't let them take me.

344
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,220
I'm the last hope.

345
00:20:47,220 --> 00:21:03,540
For you now!

346
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:06,740
Did we hit him?

347
00:21:06,820 --> 00:21:07,640
I couldn't tell.

348
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:12,640
But even if he's alive, that's a strong magic region. The environment will kill him before long.

349
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:15,640
And I don't know about you two, but I'd rather not chase him.

350
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:17,640
Yeah, he'll die soon.

351
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:21,640
Serves him right. Damn resistance. Let's go.

352
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:27,640
I don't like being this close to the strong magic region. Who knows what'll happen if we stay too long.

353
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:29,640
Heh. Nothing good.

354
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:37,640
You say this is the son of one of the Mage Defense Force's former commanders?

355
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:45,640
Yes. We interrogated one of the rebel conspirators we captured and learned that his name is Ralph. And sir, his name actually appears in a...

356
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:56,640
It matters not. Let this fly buzz around as he will. We'll swat him down if he decides to stand in the way of our grand design.

357
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:04,640
Tonsure Man

358
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:19,960
Walk on my way

359
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:24,400
Haleに転んで傷ついて

360
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:29,900
気付けば誰ももうどこにもいない

361
00:22:29,900 --> 00:22:35,080
歪んだ世界に魔法の言葉で

362
00:22:35,080 --> 00:22:41,820
光が射すなら飛びつくんだろう

363
00:22:41,820 --> 00:22:50,900
今目の前に残るのは希望か

364
00:22:50,900 --> 00:22:58,960
掴みかけた若干な幸福が

365
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:01,660
まだ消せない誓い叫んでる

366
00:23:01,660 --> 00:23:03,980
忘れないように叫んでる

367
00:23:03,980 --> 00:23:06,460
泣きたいほど遠くだって

368
00:23:06,460 --> 00:23:08,960
全然届かなくても

369
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:13,540
信じる君は赤い手前を向いている

370
00:23:13,540 --> 00:23:16,420
だから枯れないように柄がって

371
00:23:16,420 --> 00:23:19,800
描いた夢また歩き出せる

372
00:23:19,800 --> 00:23:24,600
きっと僕を呼ぶ声だ

373
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:31,300
次回は Black Cloverの第1章をご覧ください

374
00:23:31,300 --> 00:23:37,300
次回は Black Cloverの第1章をご覧ください

375
00:23:37,300 --> 00:23:39,680
Who am I you ask

376
00:23:39,680 --> 00:23:41,840
I guess I wouldn't mind sharing a little

377
00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:43,600
Next time on Black Clover

378
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:44,880
Page 157

379
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,360
Five Leaf Clover

380
00:23:46,360 --> 00:23:48,380
Within the Clover's fifth leaf

381
